{
  "title": "Vitalis 周报 · 本周睡眠与训练结构",
  "content": "<div style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 12px 18px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#eef3f3;color:#14202b;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#0f3d3a;color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#9fd3c9\">VITALIS · 周报</p><h1 style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;color:#ffffff\">本周睡眠与训练结构</h1><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#c5e3dd\">2026-09-28—2026-10-04 · 数据截至 2026-10-07 21:20 · 合成数据</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">关键记录</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">平均睡眠</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">7 小时</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#7a8892\">本期睡眠仅有 2/7 晚，未达到趋势比较门槛。</p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">平均步数</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">7,100 步/日</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#eef2f4;color:#4a5964;font-weight:600\">持平</span> <span style=\"color:#7a8892\">上期 · 2026-09-21—2026-09-27 · 7,100 步/日</span></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">睡眠与恢复变化</h2>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">睡眠有效 2 天，平均</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">420 分钟</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">本周仅有 2 晚睡眠记录，暂不比较趋势。</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">跑步与力量结构</h2>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">训练场次</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">0 次</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:2px 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a8892\">训练合计只覆盖已记录日期，不能当作完整周期总量。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#7a8892;text-align:center\">由 Vitalis 根据已保存数据生成，无需回复</p>\n</div>",
